    "Clove checks once a day, downloads in the background, and installs when you quit. Settings, About turns it off or checks now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove checks once a day, downloads in the background, and installs when you quit. Settings, About turns it off or checks now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 每天检查一次更新，在后台下载，并在退出时安装。可在“设置”的“关于”中关闭或立即检查。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
