          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clove reads processes straight from macOS and stops refreshing when its window is closed. Idle, it uses about a quarter of what it did." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove reads processes straight from macOS and stops refreshing when its window is closed. Idle, it uses about a quarter of what it did."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 直接从 macOS 读取进程，并在窗口关闭时停止刷新。闲置时的占用约为以前的四分之一。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 直接從 macOS 讀取程序，並在視窗關閉時停止重新整理。閒置時的佔用約為以前的四分之一。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clove reads these folders in your home directory. They are never modified." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove reads these folders in your home directory. They are never modified."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 读取个人文件夹中的这些文件夹，不会修改它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 讀取個人檔案夾中的這些檔案夾，不會修改它們。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clove uses git worktree remove, so branches and their commits stay. The folders don't go to the Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove uses git worktree remove, so branches and their commits stay. The folders don't go to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 使用 git worktree remove，因此分支及其提交会保留。文件夹不会移到废纸篓。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove 使用 git worktree remove，因此分支及其提交會保留。檔案夾不會移到垃圾桶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clove writes skill files only when you install, edit, or remove one. Anything replaced goes to the Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clove writes skill files only when you install, edit, or remove one. Anything replaced goes to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在你安装、编辑或移除 Skill 时，Clove 才会写入 Skill 文件。被替换的内容会移到废纸篓。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅在你安裝、編輯或移除 Skill 時，Clove 才會寫入 Skill 檔案。被替換的內容會移到垃圾桶。"
