    "Commands and tools an agent may run without stopping to ask you first. Claude Code saves them when you approve a command with “always allow.”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Commands and tools an agent may run without stopping to ask you first. Claude Code saves them when you approve a command with “always allow.”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理可以直接运行、无需先询问你的命令和工具。你选择“始终允许”来批准命令时，Claude Code 会保存这些权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
