    "Skills and commands you don't use still take up room in every agent session. Clove checks your history to find them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skills and commands you don't use still take up room in every agent session. Clove checks your history to find them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未使用的 Skill 和命令仍会占用每次代理会话的上下文。Clove 会检查历史记录，找出这些项目。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未使用的 Skill 和命令仍會佔用每次代理會話的上下文。Clove 會檢查歷史記錄，找出這些項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
