    "Storage lists Xcode build files, old device support, package downloads, and more, with what each is and what happens after. It all goes to the Trash first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Storage lists Xcode build files, old device support, package downloads, and more, with what each is and what happens after. It all goes to the Trash first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“储存空间”会列出 Xcode 构建文件、旧设备支持文件、软件包下载等，并说明每项是什么、清理后会怎样。所有内容都会先移到废纸篓。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「儲存空間」會列出 Xcode 建置檔案、舊裝置支援檔案、軟體包下載等，並說明每項是什麼、清理後會怎樣。所有內容都會先移到垃圾桶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
