          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在使用的版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the Trash first, so you can put them back from here until you empty it. Caches for open apps, for macOS, and folders you keep are left alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They go to the Trash first, so you can put them back from here until you empty it. Caches for open apps, for macOS, and folders you keep are left alone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缓存会先移到废纸篓。在清倒之前，可以从这里放回原处。不会改动正在运行的应用、macOS 或你保留的文件夹的缓存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快取會先移到垃圾桶。在清倒之前，可以從這裡放回原處。不會改動正在執行的應用程式、macOS 或你保留的檔案夾的快取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They take up %@ tokens in every agent session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They take up %@ tokens in every agent session."
          }
