    "You won't be able to resume these sessions. Clove keeps its record of which skills you used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You won't be able to resume these sessions. Clove keeps its record of which skills you used."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些会话将无法恢复。Clove 会保留 Skill 使用记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些會話將無法恢復。Clove 會保留 Skill 使用記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll get a line for your shell and a command for MCP servers. Neither writes the key down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll get a line for your shell and a command for MCP servers. Neither writes the key down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里会提供 Shell 配置行和 MCP 服务器命令，都不会明文保存密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡會提供 Shell 配置行和 MCP 伺服器命令，都不會明文儲存金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll see its SKILL.md, its security audits, and how many people use it. Installing takes one click." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll see its SKILL.md, its security audits, and how many people use it. Installing takes one click."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里会显示 SKILL.md、安全审查和使用人数。一点即可安装。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡會顯示 SKILL.md、安全審查和使用人數。一點即可安裝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll see its branch, what's uncommitted, who's working in it, and whether it's safe to remove." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll see its branch, what's uncommitted, who's working in it, and whether it's safe to remove."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你会看到它的分支、未提交的内容、谁在其中工作，以及能否安全移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你會看到它的分支、未提交的內容、誰在其中工作，以及能否安全移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll see what it does, where it applies, and what it costs your agents. Most can be shared with your other agents from here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll see what it does, where it applies, and what it costs your agents. Most can be shared with your other agents from here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里会显示它的用途、适用范围和上下文用量。大多数项目都能在此共享给其他代理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡會顯示它的用途、適用範圍和上下文用量。大多數項目都能在此共享給其他代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll see what started it, where it runs, and how much memory it holds. Stop it here if it's left over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll see what started it, where it runs, and how much memory it holds. Stop it here if it's left over."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里会显示谁启动了它、运行位置和内存用量。可以停止不再需要的进程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡會顯示誰啟動了它、執行位置和記憶體用量。可以停止不再需要的程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
